LAMMPS (10 Sep 2025 - Development - patch_10Sep2025-457-gabba7fcf55)
# 64-atom diamond-Si NVE molecular dynamics

variable dt index 0.001
variable direct_plugin index ../../direct/build/tersoffnndirectplugin.so

units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

plugin load ${direct_plugin}
plugin load ../../direct/build/tersoffnndirectplugin.so
Loading plugin: Tersoff NN pair style with hand-written MLP inference by Yusuke Nishimura

lattice diamond 5.431
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5.431 5.431 5.431
region box block 0 2 0 2 0 2
create_box 1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (10.862 10.862 10.862)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 64 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (10.862 10.862 10.862)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds
mass 1 28.0855

pair_style tersoff_nn_direct model_name ../../models/JSAP_autumn_2026/model_direct.txt input_stats ../../models/JSAP_autumn_2026/input_stats.csv use_gpu no
pair_coeff * * ../../models/JSAP_autumn_2026/Si.tersoff Si_NN
Reading tersoff_nn potential file ../../models/JSAP_autumn_2026/Si.tersoff with DATE: 2011-04-26

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

velocity all create 300.0 4928459 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve

timestep ${dt}
timestep 0.0010
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step time etotal
thermo_modify format float %.15g
run 1000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 5.5
  ghost atom cutoff = 5.5
  binsize = 2.75, bins = 4 4 4
  1 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 0 0
  (1) pair tersoff_nn_direct, perpetual
      attributes: full, newton on
      pair build: full/bin/atomonly
      stencil: full/bin/3d
      bin: standard
